// Investigation: VNet flow logs summary. Only works if Traffic Analytics is on (it is NOT in this lab),
// so by default read the JSON blobs in the flow-log storage account instead:
//   container insights-logs-flowlogflowevent (az storage blob list / download).
// If you enable Traffic Analytics on your own, this query summarises denied and allowed flows.
NTANetAnalytics
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| summarize flows = count(), bytes = sum(BytesSrcToDest + BytesDestToSrc) by SrcIp, DestIp, DestPort, FlowStatus
| order by flows desc
